# Pairs with FailClosed: an unmatched control-plane request inherits the permissive data-plane default effect.

MODULE: DefaultAllowsControlPlane
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an unmatched control-plane request inherits the permissive data-plane default effect
PERTURBS: Evaluate

--- FIND
                      THEN IF m.matched /\ m.effect = "Allow" THEN "Allow" ELSE "Deny"
--- REPLACE
                      THEN IF m.matched /\ m.effect = "Allow" THEN "Allow" ELSE DefaultEffect
--- END
